  "content": "[Intro]\n[E]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[E]The night we\nmet I knew I\n[F#m]needed you\n[B7]so\n[E]And if I\nhad the chance I'd\n[F#m]never let you\n[B7]go\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[G#7]So won't you\nsay you love me\n[C#7]I'll make you\nso proud of me\n[F#]We'll make 'em turn\ntheir heads\n[B7]every place we go\nSo won't you,\n\n[Chorus]\n[E]please\nBe my little\n[C#m]baby,\nSay you'll be my dar-\n[A]lin',\nBe my baby\n[B7]now\nWha oh oh oh\n\n[Verse 2]\n[E]I'll make you\nhappy, baby,\n[F#m]just wait and\n[B7]see\n[E]For every kiss\nyou give me\n[F#m]I'll give you\n[B7]three\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[G#7]Oh, since the\nday I saw you\n[C#7]I have been\nwaiting for you\n[F#]You know I will\nadore you\n[B7]'til eternity\nSo won't you, please\n\n[Chorus]\n[E]\nBe my little\n[C#m]baby,\nSay you'll be my dar-\n[A]lin',\nBe my baby\n[B7]now\nWha oh oh oh\n\n[Strings Solo]\n[E]\n[F#m]\n[B7]\n[E]\n[F#m]\n[B7]So come on and,\n\n[Chorus]\n[E]please\nBe my little\n[C#m]baby,\nSay you'll be my dar-\n[A]lin',\nBe my baby\n[B7]now\nWha oh oh oh\n\n[Break]\n\n[Chorus]\n[E]\n[C#m]\n[A]\n[B7]\n\n[Outro (Fade out)]\n[E]\n[C#m]\n[A]\nBe my baby\n[B7]now",
